# TRK IN: a WEFT patch (T2) takes T1's sound through its LP; T1 then plays only there; muting T2 gives it back.
wait 300
settp 1 KIND 1
settp 2 KIND 6
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 100
tapkey 0
tapkey 4
tapkey 7
tapkey 11
tapkey 14
tapkey 18
tapkey 21
tapkey 24
wait 100
tap HOME
wset 2 0 1 68
wset 2 7 1 0
wset 2 7 2 100
wset 2 0 2 6
wset 2 1 2 1
wset 2 3 2 100
wset 2 7 3 10
wset 2 7 4 20
wset 2 5 0 2
wset 2 10 0 1
wait 100
tap PLAY
wait 800

wait 2000
wset 2 7 3 120
wait 2000
tap GLO
wait 10
press GLO
key 2 down
key 2 up
release GLO
wait 2000

expect mutes 2
